# Matrices

Write a matrix with `pmatrix`, then work with it.

$$ A := \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 2 \\ 3 & 4 \end{pmatrix} $$

$$ B := \begin{pmatrix} 0 & 1 \\ 1 & 0 \end{pmatrix} $$

The product keeps the order you write it in:

$$ A B = ? $$

$$ B A = ? $$

$$ A^{-1} = ? $$

$$ A^T = ? $$

$$ \det A = ? $$

$$ \operatorname{rank} A = ? $$

A matrix times a vector:

$$ A \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix} = ? $$
